# Where the API lives. Keep /api:
#   - in development Vite forwards /api to http://localhost:5000
#   - on Vercel, vercel.json forwards /api to the Render API (same-site login cookie)
# Only set a full URL if the API is served some other way, e.g.
#   VITE_API_URL=https://paisa-pal-api.onrender.com/api
VITE_API_URL=/api
